  "ruleText": "Rev 1008.07 Form CD-18, Tobacco Tax Credit Bond. Form CD-18, “Tobacco Tax Credit Bond”, shall be completed and filed with the department’s collections division by licensed wholesalers to establish a charge account with the department.\n\nSource. #6662, eff 12-25-97; ss by #8526, eff 12-21-05; ss by #10536, eff 3-6-14; ss by #13817, eff 12-1-23 (formerly Rev 1009.06 (see Revision Note #2 at chapter heading for Rev 1000)",
